<p><strong>↪ Follow-up: "Which would you choose for a service that generates heavy PDF reports?"</strong> Either — but the CPU work must not run on the request-handling thread of an event loop: move it to a worker thread, a job queue or a separate service, and limit how many run at once. Capstone step 2 is this exact bug, measured and fixed. 📍 CS.3 slides 5, 14–19 and 23; CS.4; capstone slides 19–20.</p>
